<div class="examples u-grid gap-6">
<figure class="example @grid:col-span-6">
<p class="example-verdict example-verdict-dont">Don’t</p>
<div class="example-frame nav-dont">
<nav class="u-nav" aria-label="Example, before">
<div><p>Work</p><ul><li><a><%= render "icon", name: "wrench", small: true %><span>Jobs</span></a></li><li><a>Quotes</a></li></ul></div>
<div><p>People</p><ul><li><a><%= render "icon", name: "users", small: true %><span>Customers</span></a></li><li><a>Staff</a></li></ul></div>
<div><p>Settings</p><ul><li><a>Settings</a></li></ul></div>
</nav>
</div>
<figcaption class="example-caption example-caption-dont">Some links have icons and some don't, so the labels never line up. Grey headings name groups that can't fold, and Settings fills a group on its own.</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure class="example @grid:col-span-6">
<p class="example-verdict example-verdict-do">Do</p>
<div class="example-frame nav-do">
<nav class="u-nav" aria-label="Example, after">
<div><ul><li><a><%= render "icon", name: "wrench", small: true %><span>Jobs</span></a></li><li><a><%= render "icon", name: "file", small: true %><span>Quotes</span></a></li></ul></div>
<div><ul><li><a><%= render "icon", name: "users", small: true %><span>Customers</span></a></li></ul></div>
<details open><summary><%= render "icon", name: "settings", small: true %><span>Settings</span></summary><ul><li><a>General</a></li><li><a>Team</a></li></ul></details>
</nav>
</div>
<figcaption class="example-caption example-caption-do">Every top-level link has an icon, space separates the groups, and Settings folds because it has pages under it.</figcaption>
</figure>
</div>
